* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Member    MENUNOM
* Version   3.2
* Function  Start NOM menu
*
* Maintenance
* -----------
* uuuuuu yyyy-mm-dd P999999 Remark
* fhi    2007-11-02 FHI240  Rewritten to allow starting from any NAT lib without NSC
* fhi    2009-03-03 P300323 Rename RGETSTEP --> NOMGSTEP
*
* ----------------------------------------------------- MAIN -------------------------
*
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #RC             (N4)
END-DEFINE
CALLNAT 'NOMGSTEP' '*' #RC
IF #RC NE 0
WRITE / / / 'Steplibs not set, please check Natural parameter module.' /
    'Steplibs konnten nicht gesetzt werden, bitte Natural Parameter Modul pruefen.' /
END-IF
FETCH 'NRM'
END
